          "description": "The BrainBots are out of the classroom and heading back in time to learn as much as they can about dinosaurs. In this card Nellie, Buzz and Gibbs explore Corythosaurus and find out what similarities a dinosaur has with a cow (and discover a new tongue twister along the way!) \n\nTest your knowledge at the end of the card to see how many BrainBank facts you can remember about these amazing creatures."
